{"name": "All Dice on Deck", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All Dice on Deck</strong>\u00a0is a Pirate Roguelite of Risk and Reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a strategic dice-rolling adventure where you'll push your luck, upgrade your fleet, and claim the legendary treasure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get a Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one of many unique vessels and embark on a  journey to reach the final island. Your goal is the legendary treasure marked by the\u00a0<strong>X</strong> on your map.\u00a0Every ship offers different starting stats and unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/abdc053a0d31b5c0777fab4f79fb1033.poster.avif?t=1781527671\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/abdc053a0d31b5c0777fab4f79fb1033.webm?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/abdc053a0d31b5c0777fab4f79fb1033.mp4?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set sail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey from island to island. Every step forward requires you to roll the <strong>Island's\u00a0Danger Dice</strong> alongside your own <strong>Ship Dice</strong>. If you survive you'll get to roll the <strong>Island's\u00a0Treasure Dice</strong> and fill your hold with gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/1ab64c7523e2ac6e8b90c0a70b3277b7.poster.avif?t=1781527671\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/1ab64c7523e2ac6e8b90c0a70b3277b7.webm?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/1ab64c7523e2ac6e8b90c0a70b3277b7.mp4?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The further you sail, the greater the danger and the bigger the reward. Each island is more treacherous than the last. Will you risk everything for one more roll, or play it safe and return to the Port with your loot? Remember: if your ship sinks, you lose everything you've gathered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/d54727ba544a6b6dff11044777799850.poster.avif?t=1781527671\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/d54727ba544a6b6dff11044777799850.webm?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/d54727ba544a6b6dff11044777799850.mp4?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Return to the Port to spend your acquired gold and turn your small ship into a <strong>Mighty Galleon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reinforce the Hull</strong>\u00a0and<strong>\u00a0i</strong>ncrease your ship's health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Arsenal</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0gain additional <strong>Ship Dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Establish Outposts</strong>\u00a0and skip early islands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Other unique upgrades</strong> that will help you on your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/9c97d3b235421348b9857b638648c379.poster.avif?t=1781527671\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/9c97d3b235421348b9857b638648c379.webm?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/9c97d3b235421348b9857b638648c379.mp4?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find the Legendary Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Getting to the last island will be difficult. It will require a lot of patience, strategic upgrades, and a bit of luck. Can you conquer the odds? What mysteries lie hidden in the ancient treasure chest on the island marked by the <strong>X</strong>? Only the most daring captains will find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"404\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/086fe5f2da5a44009fd0905c05d68cf7.poster.avif?t=1781527671\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/086fe5f2da5a44009fd0905c05d68cf7.webm?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/extras/086fe5f2da5a44009fd0905c05d68cf7.mp4?t=1781527671\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "All Dice on Deck is a pirate roguelite where every island is a gamble. Set sail and roll the dice! Push your luck or play it safe. Upgrade your ship and even the odds. Reach the final island and claim the Legendary Treasure!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4430870/5f3bac2e93bd269813c3923590fa044d3cceb28a/header.jpg?t=1781527671", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Idler", "Roguelite", "Fishing", "PvE", "Board Game", "Tabletop"], "developers": "Igrek Games", "publishers": "Igrek Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4430870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/2UXE_drUBok", "first_seen": 1775512800.0, "review_rank": 871}